      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The area’s varying elevations create distinct microclimates that shape local vegetation and wildlife.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.marincountyvisitor.com/history-of-lagunitas-forest-knolls-marin-county-california/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "San Geronimo Creek, also called Paper Mill Creek, runs through both towns and is one of the few remaining spawning grounds for endangered Coho salmon.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
